<div class="sheet-content"><header class="board-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">Tactical command</span><h1>Battle Board</h1><p>One die. One unit. Every decision counts.</p></div><div class="round-badge"><b>{{round}}</b><span>ROUND</span></div></header><div class="command-bar"><button type="button" class="primary" data-action="draw" {{#unless isGM}}disabled{{/unless}}>Draw order die</button><button type="button" data-action="nextRound" {{#unless isGM}}disabled{{/unless}}>Next round</button><span>{{ready}} / {{unitCount}} units awaiting orders</span></div><div class="bag-status">Drawn side: <strong>{{drawnSide}}</strong> · {{remainingDice}} dice remaining{{#if activeUnitName}} · Active: {{activeUnitName}}{{/if}}</div><div class="toolbar setup-toolbar"><button type="button" data-action="createSquad" {{#unless isGM}}disabled{{/unless}}>+ Create squad</button><button type="button" data-action="importStarter" {{#unless isGM}}disabled{{/unless}}>Import starter collection</button><button type="button" data-action="configureScene" {{#unless isGM}}disabled{{/unless}}>Configure scene</button></div>{{#if armies}}<div class="army-strip">{{#each armies}}<button type="button" data-action="open" data-uuid="{{uuid}}"><b>{{name}}</b><small>{{count}} units · {{points}} / {{limit}} pts</small></button>{{/each}}</div>{{/if}}<section><div class="section-heading"><h3>Units in the field</h3><span class="eyebrow">Shared orders · individual soldiers</span></div><div class="unit-grid">{{#each units}}<article class="unit-card {{#if activated}}activated{{/if}} {{#if destroyed}}destroyed{{/if}}"><div class="unit-card-top"><img src="{{img}}" alt="" width="44" height="44"><div><span class="eyebrow">{{side}} · {{kind}}</span><button type="button" class="text-button" data-action="open" data-uuid="{{uuid}}">{{name}}</button><small>{{army}}</small></div><span class="pin-badge">{{pins}}<small>PINS</small></span></div><div class="unit-card-stats"><span>{{quality}}</span><span>{{living}} soldiers</span><strong>{{#if destroyed}}Destroyed{{else}}{{order}}{{/if}}</strong></div><div class="toolbar"><button type="button" data-action="select" data-uuid="{{uuid}}">Select tokens</button><button type="button" data-action="activate" data-uuid="{{uuid}}" {{#unless ../isGM}}disabled{{/unless}} {{#if activated}}disabled{{/if}} {{#if destroyed}}disabled{{/if}}>Activate unit</button></div></article>{{else}}<div class="empty-state"><h2>Build your first force</h2><p>Import the starter collection for reusable profiles, then create a squad. Deploy its soldiers onto your scene and draw an order die to begin.</p></div>{{/each}}</div></section><p class="advisory">Measure ranges and assess terrain on the table. Allocate casualties from the unit roster. Special rules and close quarters reactions require adjudication.</p></div>
